# ==========================================
# CLOUDFLARE PAGES REWRITES (_redirects)
# ==========================================

# 1. 301 Permanent Canonical Redirects for www / http -> https://pixelisolate.online
https://www.pixelisolate.online/* https://pixelisolate.online/:splat 301!
http://www.pixelisolate.online/*  https://pixelisolate.online/:splat 301!
http://pixelisolate.online/*      https://pixelisolate.online/:splat 301!

# 2. 301 Permanent Redirects for .html and Inbound Broken URLs
/index.html      https://pixelisolate.online/           301!
/privacy.html    https://pixelisolate.online/privacy    301!
/terms.html      https://pixelisolate.online/terms      301!
/refund.html     https://pixelisolate.online/refund     301!
/sitemap.html    https://pixelisolate.online/sitemap    301!
/Pixel           https://pixelisolate.online/           301!
/pixel           https://pixelisolate.online/           301!

# 3. Backend API Proxy (Proxy to Express backend on Render)
/api/*           https://pixelisolate-backend.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

# 4. Single Page App Fallback (Serves /index.html with HTTP 200 OK for root app routes)
/*               /index.html            200
